# ====================================================
# HOSTING & SPARK VS BLAZE PLAN NOTES:
# ====================================================
# 1. Firebase Spark Plan (Free Tier):
#    - Firestore (50k reads/day, 20k writes/day) is 100% free.
#    - Firebase Authentication is 100% free.
#    - Standard client-side static hosting is supported on Spark.
#    - Outbound networking from cloud functions is restricted on Spark.
#
# 2. Firebase App Hosting / Next.js SSR on Cloud Functions:
#    - Requires upgrading project to the Blaze (Pay-as-you-go) plan
#      to enable Node.js server container runtimes.
#    - Alternatively, this Next.js app can be deployed with 100% static export
#      or hosted on Vercel with zero server costs while connecting to Firebase Firestore.
